- id: C:behaviour/vulture.package-exports
  type: behaviour
  name: The package's public names
  summary: The vulture package re-exports the class Vulture and the string __version__.
  stance: observed
  of:
  - C:component/vulture
  when: the package is imported ("import vulture" or "from vulture import Vulture, __version__")
  does: Imports Vulture from vulture.core and __version__ from vulture.version, so both are reachable as attributes
