- id: N:decision/static-over-coverage
  type: decision
  name: Static analysis rather than running the code
  summary: Vulture analyses source statically instead of running it, unlike coverage, which is more reliable but
    needs every branch run.
  stance: observed
  chose: static analysis with the ast module
  over:
  - option: coverage measurement
    because: it requires all branches of the code to actually be run
  - option: using coverage.py to detect false positives
    because: the workflow is too complicated
  because: It is fast and needs no test run; dynamic uses are then handled by whitelists.
