- id: C:reliance/V-R18
  type: reliance
  name: which line a noqa comment is on
  summary: 'Lines for `# noqa` are counted after splitting the text at every line boundary Unicode knows (form feed,
    U+2028, U+0085 and others), while the parser counts only `\n`: after such a character a `# noqa` is looked for
    one line off, and the import it means is still reported.'
  stance: observed
  worksheet-id: V-R18
  'on': language
  of:
  - C:dependency/python
  used-by:
